{
"file": 927,
"paths": [
"d008/d103/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "271da6bd",
"en_raw": "Come in here"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "a550d6d9",
"en_raw": "...Don't worry"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "89f80fe6",
"en_raw": "Go in / Run away  Um... well..."
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a530caf6",
"en_raw": "Excuse me!"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "0c5c6c78",
"en_raw": "...All right"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "291b66b0",
"en_raw": "Why..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "7aa93252",
"en_raw": "would you do this to me?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "15c62aa4",
"en_raw": "Sorry for frightening you"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "1a4bd049",
"en_raw": "I know it's childish"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "f6788e61",
"en_raw": "but I can't control myself..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "deebd145",
"en_raw": "I badly wanted you"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "89ce3f8d",
"en_raw": "to understand"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3f38c5f8",
"en_raw": "You who were with"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "0660c3f0",
"en_raw": "that girl..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "eaa2a791",
"en_raw": "That girl..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "60b643e1",
"en_raw": "do you mean Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "606737e7",
"en_raw": "Does it have something"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "7c826e74",
"en_raw": "to do with Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "c99f8cc9",
"en_raw": "...I killed her..."
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "2817f5a7",
"en_raw": "...What?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "be809f53",
"en_raw": "I killed her"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "0a5cab86",
"en_raw": "W-what do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "9c4fc9b8",
"en_raw": "I don't really understand..."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "a1ccd02c",
"en_raw": "...It was thirteen years ago..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "cd59aa68",
"en_raw": "That girl"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "daa6e54f",
"en_raw": "always carried a clown in her arms"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "be3220e8",
"en_raw": "It was a broken music box"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d0602f98",
"en_raw": "it only played a mad melody"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "27a229d9",
"en_raw": "At times the girl would sing along"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "aec83603",
"en_raw": "with an off-key tune"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "fd12d184",
"en_raw": "I could never suppress the fear"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2b16c299",
"en_raw": "it caused me"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "bdfa2edc",
"en_raw": "Just hearing it made me tremble"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "dee46160",
"en_raw": "And I, still immature"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "759609d5",
"en_raw": "like covering a stinking pot with a lid"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "0e157edc",
"en_raw": "locked the girl in this basement cell"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "d6d657d9",
"en_raw": "It was all I could do..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "38328eed",
"en_raw": "Her blackened madness"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "f703de14",
"en_raw": "had begun to infect those around her"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "42e13aa7",
"en_raw": "But, but you see..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "5e73fe43",
"en_raw": "she escaped by her own power"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "f01aefbb",
"en_raw": "and vanished into the forest"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f0b1590f",
"en_raw": "that spreads behind this building..."
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "86b7337c",
"en_raw": "On the sixth day, early morning"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "38c1dd0d",
"en_raw": "she was found dead..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "25e88c4f",
"en_raw": "Can you believe it? Deep in the forest"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "737728da",
"en_raw": "at the bottom of an old well"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "d96005a2",
"en_raw": "crouched, with a faint smile"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "cefc59f9",
"en_raw": "she'd starved to death"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "0a70402b",
"en_raw": "her eyes wide open..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "86f68064",
"en_raw": "Hatred... and mockery"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "381a7f9f",
"en_raw": "Those were not human eyes"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "7160919e",
"en_raw": "hating everything while, at the same time"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "ddbc263c",
"en_raw": "seeming to try to swallow it all"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "24bc41d4",
"en_raw": "Those... those..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "59cb1802",
"en_raw": "cloudy... pupils..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b7e37e24",
"en_raw": "that make you want to claw them out"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "6643b26f",
"en_raw": "For these thirteen years, I tried to forget"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "59f5f53a",
"en_raw": "I thought I could forget"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "62ef07f7",
"en_raw": "But then she appeared with you"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "35de198f",
"en_raw": "that girl..."
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "091e563e",
"en_raw": "She really looks just like her!"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "6458d4a7",
"en_raw": "The eyes differ, but that face"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "8e95cf2c",
"en_raw": "that bearing, and that voice..."
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "3d58e8ae",
"en_raw": "This tune... can it be!"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "7a336215",
"en_raw": "Nao, let's go~"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "b87eae26",
"en_raw": "...I see... it is so after all"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "7474b599",
"en_raw": "...Do you believe in curses?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "396d9ef1",
"en_raw": "No, Shiina isn't..."
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "dbeaee9e",
"en_raw": "I believe, she came"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "59d224f3",
"en_raw": "You brought her"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "3f69ffdb",
"en_raw": "She came out"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "13a84a95",
"en_raw": "from the darkness below"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "2343db29",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "09b03c49",
"en_raw": "So I too am finally to be judged..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "d1369ea7",
"en_raw": "Very well"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "f0993b87",
"en_raw": "if now is the time..."
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "af0b8270",
"en_raw": "take my hand and lead me"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "c5878191",
"en_raw": "...into your darkness..."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "fafd0410",
"en_raw": "............"
}
]
}